ervative Party member of  parliament or a Liberal Democrat they  will continue to do that and fulfill  that role until the next election final  thought before we let you go dr. Lee if  Jeremy Corbyn forgive me Jeremy hum  Russians they had had won the leadership  race would you still be in the same  position well it's a hypothetical I mean  I suspect Jeremy be wrestling with the  same things that Boris Johnson is  wrestling with but he probably would be  doing it with a bit more she was a bit  too people around him who don't engage  in bullying tactics so maybe it would  have been different but I think  realistically in time this was  inevitable I haven't left my party my  party has left me  my values remain the same
 

